---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="Financial Disclaimer - FinForge">
  <div class="docs-grid">
    <aside class="docs-sidebar">
      <a href={`${base}docs/`}>Overview</a>
      <a href={`${base}docs/installation/`}>Installation</a>
      <a href={`${base}docs/features/`}>Features</a>
      <a href={`${base}docs/guides/`}>Guides</a>
      <a href={`${base}docs/disclaimer/`} class:list={['active']}>Disclaimer</a>
    </aside>
    <div class="docs-content">
      <h1>Financial Disclaimer</h1>

      <h2>Important notice</h2>
      <p>
        This software ("FinForge") is provided as a tool for data organization and
        analysis only. It is NOT a financial advisor, investment advisor, or financial
        professional service.
      </p>

      <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
      <p>
        The developers, authors, and contributors of this software do not provide
        financial advice, investment recommendations, or investment guidance.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Do not use this software as the sole basis for making investment decisions</li>
        <li>Do not rely on this software's output to buy, sell, or hold any financial instruments</li>
        <li>Past performance data does not guarantee future results</li>
        <li>All investment strategies carry risk, including the potential loss of principal</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
      <p>You are solely responsible for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Verifying all data and calculations generated by this software</li>
        <li>Conducting your own due diligence before making any investment decision</li>
        <li>Consulting with a qualified financial advisor, tax professional, or attorney before making financial decisions</li>
        <li>Understanding the risks associated with investments you make</li>
        <li>Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations in your jurisdiction</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>No warranty for investment outcomes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>This software makes no guarantees about accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of financial data</li>
        <li>Market data may be delayed, inaccurate, or incomplete</li>
        <li>Technical errors, bugs, or data corruption may occur without notice</li>
        <li>No warranty is provided that investment decisions based on this software will be profitable or minimize losses</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data security and privacy</h2>
      <p>This software handles sensitive financial data. You are responsible for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Securing your system and data</li>
        <li>Protecting access to this software and any files it creates</li>
        <li>Backing up your financial data</li>
        <li>Complying with data privacy laws applicable to you</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The developers are NOT responsible for unauthorized access, data breaches, or
        loss of data.
      </p>

      <h2>Regulatory compliance</h2>
      <p>This software does not provide compliance with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Securities laws or regulations</li>
        <li>Investment advisor registration requirements</li>
        <li>Broker-dealer regulations</li>
        <li>Tax reporting or filing requirements</li>
        <li>Any other financial regulatory framework</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You are responsible for ensuring your use complies with all applicable laws.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, the authors, contributors, and
        distributors of this software are not liable for:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Investment losses or financial damages</li>
        <li>Incorrect or misleading financial analysis</li>
        <li>Data loss, corruption, or theft</li>
        <li>Any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages</li>
        <li>Any damages arising from reliance on this software for investment decisions</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Consult professionals</h2>
      <p>Before making any investment decision, consult:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>A licensed financial advisor</li>
        <li>A tax professional or CPA</li>
        <li>A securities lawyer (if applicable)</li>
        <li>Other appropriate professionals in your jurisdiction</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Acknowledgment</h2>
      <p>By using this software, you acknowledge and agree that:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You understand this software is not financial advice</li>
        <li>You assume all risks associated with your investment decisions</li>
        <li>You will not hold the developers liable for investment outcomes</li>
        <li>You accept full responsibility for your financial decisions</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
